{
  "info": {
    "name": "IOES - Question Bank API (Full) - via Gateway",
    "description": "Postman collection đầy đủ cho Question Bank module - TẤT CẢ gọi qua API Gateway.\n\n## Architecture\n- **Gateway**: http://localhost:8080 (Spring Cloud Gateway)\n- **Auth Service**: port 9000 (JWT issuance)\n- **Content Service**: port 9001 (Topics CRUD)\n- **Exam Suite**: port 9005 (Questions, Question Bank)\n\n## Security (ADR-008)\n- Tất cả request phải có JWT token trong header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`\n- Token lấy từ `/api/auth/login` (auth-service qua gateway)\n- Gateway validate JWT bằng `common-jwt` trước khi forward\n\n## Features Tested\n- CRUD Questions (MCQ, True/False, Coding, Short Answer, Essay)\n- Topic Tree & Practice Path (content-service)\n- Similar Questions (Vector similarity - Dgraph)\n- Bulk Import (CSV/Excel)\n- Image Upload (Presigned URL - MinIO)\n- Admin Operations (Resync, Storage Health)\n- Dgraph Sync (CQRS Pattern)\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `GATEWAY_URL` = http://localhost:8080\n2. Chạy `00.2 Login - Instructor` để lấy TOKEN\n3. Chạy test theo thứ tự\n\n## Notes\n- Gateway routes được định nghĩa trong `api-gateway/application.yml`\n- Content Service: `/api/v1/topics/**` → content-service:9001\n- Question Bank: `/api/question-bank/**` → exam-suite:9005\n- Auth: `/api/auth/**` → auth-service:9000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "GATEWAY_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOKEN",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUESTION_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOPIC_ID",
      "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "SKILL_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PREREQUISITE_Q_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "BULK_JOB_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
